          "criticalSuccess": "The target is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Thatchling's Curse for 24 hours.",
          "success": "The target is momentarily disoriented and has difficulty moving in the right direction. The target takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.",
          "failure": "As success, but the penalty to its Speeds lasts for 1 minute.",
          "criticalFailure": "As failure, but the penalty to its Speeds lasts until the curse is removed or until the thatchling that created the effect is permanently destroyed, whichever comes first. In addition, when the cursed creature attempts a Survival check to Sense Direction or Track, they use the outcome for one degree of success worse than the result of their check, and they can't take the Scout exploration activity."
        }
